xplicitly-specified through model, and\nsome other model has an FK to that through model, deletion is cascaded\nfrom one of the participants in the M2M, to the through model, to its\nrelated model.", "start_line": 100, "end_line": 117, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_15776", "qualified_name": "test_15776", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 119, "end_line": 124, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_inheritance", "qualified_name": "test_inheritance", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Auto-created many-to-many through tables referencing a parent model are\ncorrectly found by the delete cascade when a child of that parent is\ndeleted.\n\nRefs #14896.", "start_line": 130, "end_line": 144, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_to_field", "qualified_name": "test_to_field", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Cascade deletion works with ForeignKey.to_field set to non-PK.", "start_line": 146, "end_line": 155, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_large_deletes", "qualified_name": "test_large_deletes", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "If the number of objects > chunk size, deletion still occurs.", "start_line": 159, "end_line": 173, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "create_image", "qualified_name": "create_image", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Return an Image referenced by both a FooImage and a FooFile.", "start_line": 183, "end_line": 196, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_delete_proxy", "qualified_name": "test_delete_proxy", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Deleting the *proxy* instance bubbles through to its non-proxy and\n*all* referring objects are deleted.", "start_line": 198, "end_line": 213, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_delete_proxy_of_proxy", "qualified_name": "test_delete_proxy_of_proxy", "args": ["self"], "decorato